# Line-ending policy: text files are stored LF in the index and checked out LF.
# This file is the single source of truth and overrides core.autocrlf on checkout
# (the author's box has core.autocrlf=true, which had left 58 tracked blobs stored
# as CRLF). Added with the `git add --renormalize .` pass that normalized them -
# those whole-file diffs are normalization, not content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never touched by the text rules
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.db-journal binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.o binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
